 "notes": "The campfire ring is a clearing west of camp with log benches around a central fire pit.  Where evening events happen: opening campfire Sunday, Reptile Skit Monday, Homesick Night Tuesday (no skit, quiet singing), Ghost Pirate Play Wednesday, Talent Show Thursday, Closing Bonfire Friday.  Path back to camp is at the south edge."
